{{IGD|Hello there!  My name's Dot and I'm an excited dog!  Let's go exploring together!}}
'''Dot''' is a [http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dalmatian_(dog) Dalmatian] [[Dogs|dog]] [[Pets|pet]] that is available to everyone for purchase through the [[Station Cash Marketplace|SC Marketplace]] at the regular price of {{SC|299}}, and to [[Membership|Members]] at the 10% discount price of {{SC|269}}.

Dot was also distributed to all players who had either a three-month, six-month, twelve-month, or lifetime membership plan through the [[Snow Days Membership Gift]] pack during [[Snow_Days#2010|2010]] [[Snow Days]].

==Tricks==

Dot can perform the following tricks:
* Speak
* Sit Up
* Roll Over
* Play Dead
* Peek-a-boo
* Handstand
* Dance

